<title>JAPAN: Seki Technotron - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Seki Technotron - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.88		vs	    4.30</p>
<p> Operating	  280    million	  vs	  200    million</p>
<p> Current	    316    million	  vs	   71    million</p>
